 being transferred.\\n     \"}}],\"ERC20InsufficientAllowance(address,uint256,uint256)\":[{\"details\":\"Indicates a failure with the `spender`’s `allowance`. Used in transfers.\",\"params\":{\"spender\":\"Address that may be allowed to operate on tokens without being their owner.\",\"allowance\":\"Amount of tokens a `spender` is allowed to operate with.\",\"needed\":\"Minimum amount required to perform a transfer.\\n     \"}}],\"ERC20InvalidApprover(address)\":[{\"details\":\"Indicates a failure with the `approver` of a token to be approved. Used in approvals.\",\"params\":{\"approver\":\"Address initiating an approval operation.\\n     \"}}],\"ERC20InvalidSpender(address)\":[{\"details\":\"Indicates a failure with the `spender` to be approved. Used in approvals.\",\"params\":{\"spender\":\"Address that may be allowed to operate on tokens without being their owner.\\n     \"}}]},\"title\":\"PonsV2LauncherToken\",\"version\":1},\"userdoc\":{\"kind\":\"user\",\"methods\":{\"constructor\":{\"notice\":\"Creates a v2 launch token and mints its entire supply to the bonding curve.\"},\"socials()\":{\"notice\":\"Returns the launch token's five social metadata fields.\\n     \"},\"getTokenInfo()\":{\"notice\":\"Returns creator and metadata in the launcher-compatible tuple.\\n     \"}},\"notice\":\"Fixed-supply ERC-20 deployed by PonsV2LaunchFactory for a v2 launch.\\n * The entire supply mints directly to the token's bonding curve instead of a\\n * Uniswap position. Anyone, the deployer included, may buy any amount from\\n * the curve at any time; the curve's own price impact and its reserved pool\\n * allocation are the only limits on a large buy. `deployer` is carried here\\n * as immutable reference data for off-chain attribution only, and confers no\\n * privileges over the token.\\n * `ERC20Burnable` lets any holder voluntarily burn their own balance; the\\n * protocol's buyback mechanism does not use it, bought-back tokens are\\n * locked into `PonsV2BuybackVault` for a five-year vest instead of being\\n * burned.\\n \",\"version\":1}},\"settings\":{\"compilationTarget\":{\"lib/crane/contracts/protocols/launchpads/ponsFamily/v2/PonsV2LauncherToken.sol\":\"PonsV2LauncherToken\"},\"evmVersion\":\"osaka\",\"libraries\":{},\"metadata\":{\"bytecodeHash\":\"ipfs\"},\"optimizer\":{\"enabled\":true,\"runs\":1},\"remappings\":[\"@battlechain-contracts/=lib/crane/lib/battlechain-lib/lib/battlechain-safe-harbor-contracts/src/\",\"@crane/=lib/crane/\",\"@matterlabs/=lib/crane/lib/battlechain-lib/lib/battlechain-safe-harbor-contracts/lib/battlechain-contracts/lib/\",\"@nomicfoundation/=node_modules/@nomicfoundation/\",\"@opengsn/=node_modules/@opengsn/\",\"@openzeppelin/=node_modules/@openzeppelin/\",\"@oz/=lib/crane/lib/openzeppelin-contracts/\",\"@ozu/=lib/crane/contracts/external/openzeppelin-upgradeable/\",\"battlechain-contracts/=lib/crane/lib/battlechain-lib/lib/battlechain-safe-harbor-contracts/lib/battlechain-contracts/\",\"battlechain-lib-mocks/=lib/crane/lib/battlechain-lib/test/mocks/\",\"battlechain-lib/=lib/crane/lib/battlechain-lib/src/\",\"battlechain-safe-harbor-contracts/=lib/crane/lib/battlechain-lib/lib/battlechain-safe-harbor-contracts/\",\"chainlink-ccip/=lib/crane/lib/chainlink-local/lib/chainlink-ccip/chains/evm/contracts/vendor/optimism/interop-lib/v0/src/\",\"chainlink-evm/=lib/crane/lib/chainlink-local/lib/chainlink-evm/\",\"chainlink-local/=lib/crane/lib/chainlink-local/src/\",\"clones/=lib/crane/contracts/external/clones-with-immutable-args/\",\"contracts/external/solady/=lib/crane/contracts/external/solady/\",\"contracts/protocols/launchpads/uniswap/continuous-clearing/=lib/crane/contracts/protocols/launchpads/uniswap/continuous-clearing/\",\"contracts/solady/=lib/crane/contracts/external/solady/\",\"crane/=lib/crane/\",\"createx/=lib/crane/lib/battlechain-lib/lib/battlechain-safe-harbor-contracts/lib/createx/src/\",\"ds-test/=lib/crane/lib/battlechain-lib/lib/battlechain-safe-harbor-contracts/lib/createx/lib/for